// ItemLogin is the Schema for the ItemLogins API. This resource creates a login item, with a username, password, TOTP secret and URIs, in the personal vault of the provider user or in an organization. Items are encrypted client-side, like Bitwarden clients do: new items get their own item key (cipher key), which is encrypted with the key of the provider user or of the organization. Updates keep the parts of the item that the provider does not manage, such as the password history, passkeys and attachments. Deleting the item deletes it permanently, without moving it to the trash. Requires email and master_password to be set in the provider configuration.
